<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 3, 2003 :: Catching up!</div><P>Sorry all, with Morlith's wedding only a few days away, I've been working on my dress! </P>
<P>Belated thanks for those that came out to kill Sont the other day to get Myschief her talisman!</P>
<P>Leveling grats, hopefully I'm not missing too many or repeating myself...<BR>Grats Bashiuss and Darkyn on 62...Twins!<BR>Grats Veleria on 60 and Warlock!<BR>Grats Valoura on 56!<BR>Grats Ewlala on 55!<BR><BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 4, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 29, 2003 :: Arglar wears a dress!</div><P>As promised, Arglar tanked in a dress with an illusion on if Greylok would do her own Ring War. And I took pictures! </P>
<P>Nice work, as always! Grats Greylok on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Cerdiwan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Sparkley on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Veleria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Antroe on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Leviathaun on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A>&nbsp;and Mahrsan on greed roll of the Earring of the Frozen Skull. </P>
<P><IMG alt=Mwahaha! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/argdress.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some leveling grats, some old, some new!<BR>Grats Tellie on 65 and Arcanist!<BR>Grats Thayet on 63!<BR>Grats Mytee on 60 and Phantasmist!<BR>Grats Kasiryn on 59!<BR>Grats Moordread on 58!<BR>Grats Tidark on 54!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 52! <BR>Grats Leviathuan on 51 and Champion!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 28, 2003 :: Bit more prismatic</div>Another quick run to Sleeper's got us two more pieces of prismatic. Grats Jenrenee on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticclaymore.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Claymore</A> and Lushissx on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticspear.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Spear</A>! <p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 25, 2003 :: Grats Ckaii on your epic!</div><P>Wonderous led Ckaii and some others to a quick clearing of Fear to get Ckaii his epic blade, finally! I was supposed to take a picture of the sexy paladin, but somehow managed to forget. I'll remedy that later! </P>
<P>Grats Mytee on 57!<BR>Grats Tidark on 51 and Champion!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 23, 2003 :: Klandicar dead</div>Thanks all for making a quick Sunday trip out to Western Wastes, and grats Lentor on your talisman! <p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 25, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 22, 2003 :: Help the Dain, Kill the Dain... we can't decide</div><P>Grats Feskan on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 59!<BR>Grats Morlith and Razillia on 52!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 50!</P>
<P>Colwn's turn was up to get his 10th ring, so we headed down and decimated lots more giants once again. Grats Colwn on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>! Wonderous got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Jenrenee got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Feskan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Yimish got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Divan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A> for greed and Jakr got <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> on greed. </P>
<P>After that, we headed on in to visit the Dain, what with being war buddies and all. Mahrsan and Vorne invited him to a private meeting and we keeled him flawlessly. Grats Ceyria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16177">Dain's Head</A> (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/belt_dwarfslaying.JPG">Belt of Dwarf Slaying</A>), Thayet on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>, Morlith on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A>, and Wonderous saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6736">Aegis of Ice</A> from rotting. </P>
<P>And I got famous pictures of feet! We know how I love feet.. But, as Myschief said, it's hard to get a good battle shot against a shortie. /nods</P>
<P><IMG alt="WOOT! Feet! Eat that, Nibbs!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainfeet.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages:  1 <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=2'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
